  "description": "Secondary, 2 souls: raise a skeleton archer. Sneak + secondary, 4 souls: raise an armored zombie with double health. Up to 4 minions at once; each crumbles to dust after 60 seconds. They attack whatever you hit or whatever hits you, and follow you if they fall far behind. You and they share the scoreboard team \"liches\".",
